<title>UK: Thorn down as Kleinwort says &quot;sell&quot;.</title>
<headline>Thorn down as Kleinwort says &quot;sell&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Thorn Plc dipped to a fresh low as brokerage Dresdner Kleinwort Benson told its clients to sell the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 0822 GMT, the shares were off 6-1/2p to 154.  </p>
<p>The analyst declined to provide details. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
